/// Named-registry resolver.
///
/// One instance per install. Mirrors upstream's named-registry shell
/// of [`createNpmResolver`](https://github.com/pnpm/pnpm/blob/b61e268d57/resolving/npm-resolver/src/index.ts#L192-L289)
